invariant: INV-16
file: ct.h
catches: unit_ct_widemul
reason: summing ct_widemul's two 16x16 cross products in 32 bits drops
  their carry, so the recombined product is wrong; every other unit
  binary asserts CH_NATIVE_WIDEMUL and compiles the line out, so the
  RFC 7748 and RFC 8439 vectors see it only over the decomposition

--- old
    uint64_t mid = (uint64_t)lh + hl;
--- new
    uint32_t mid = lh + hl;
